   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "text": "ICE administers LIBOR via IBA — on Arc roster\nApollo · BNY · Mastercard: benchmark-native\nSOFR was methodology-first, liquidity-second\nthe rate's administrator ≠ the rail's operator\n(the LIBOR neutrality lesson = the moat)",
